 ofessor in the Economics department at the London School of Economics. I
 'm also an Associate of the Centre For Macroeconomics \, a Research Affi
 liate of the CEPR in International Finance and Macroeconomics\, and an a
 ffiliated faculty with the Economic History department at LSE. I co-orga
 nize the Barcelona Summer Forum Growth and Productivity Workshop held ea
 ch June. My Google Scholar page is here . Click here to view my CV.\n\nh
 ttps://econ.ucsb.edu/events/all/2027/macro-seminar-jane-olmstead-rumsey-
